{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Groningen in Oorlogstijd, interview 01"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41838"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Oorlogs- en Verzetscentrum Groningen (OVCG)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.J.  Jongejan"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ovcg"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Hendrik Tjoelker, 12 jaar bij het uitbreken van de oorlog, woonde in Opende. Zijn vader en twee broers zaten ondergedoken. Het verzet heeft in de oorlog de zoon van NSB'er Pier Nobach doodgeschoten en als vergelding werden er vijf mannen doodgeschoten, waaronder Schuilenga. Pier Nobach en de Duitse Wehrmacht hebben ook invallen gedaan bij huize Tjoelker. De familie kende Nobach overigens ook al voor de oorlog.<br><br>00:01:00 Duitsland verovert Nederland<br><br>00:02:06 Contact met Duitsers. Trimunt.<br><br>00:03:45 Broers en vader ondergedoken<br><br>00:08:22 Pier Nobach in huize Tjoelker op zoek naar de Meindert Tjoelker. Dominee doet noodleugen<br><br>00:13:23 De moord op de zoon van Pier Nobach en de represailles die daar op volgden. Vijf mensen gearresteerd en doodgeschoten als represaille<br><br>00:17:00 Duitse Wehrmacht in huize Tjoelker. Hendrik Tjoelker ziet auto van Pier Nobach buiten staan<br><br>00:20:07 Kamp Nuis en de neef van Hendrik Tjoelker<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Opende"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Surhuisterveen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Pier Nobach"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Trimunt"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Meindert Tjoelker"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kamp Nuis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schuilenga"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Doezum"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Elzinga"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Westerkwartier"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wehrmacht"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","val